ct 12 – 18)\n\n- Shoe preference update: Saucony Endorphin Speed 4 for long runs that include an MP block (this Sunday's 15 w/ 4 at MP, and the peak long run the following Sunday with 6–8 at MP).\n- Taper long runs (3 and 2 weeks out) stay in Brooks Ghost 16 for the easy portion; Endorphin Speed 4 is OK for any short MP touch within those runs.\n- Daily easy runs (Tue/Wed/Sat) remain in Brooks Ghost 16 — Speed 4 stays a workout-only shoe.\n- Achilles watchpoint re-opened: brief whisper at mile 7 of the Oct 14 run that settled; no action beyond monitoring, maintaining heel drops, and the escalation rules in the safety note.\n	2026-10-14 22:45:37.280945+00
\.


