0, "structure": "5-min walk warm-up, then 15 mi on flat canal: 10 mi easy (Z2, HR ≤150) → 4 mi @ goal MP (8:00/mi, 7:55–8:05 window) → 1 mi easy CD. Fuel: gel at ~5 min pre-start, then every 30–35 min (4 gels total), fluids with electrolytes."}, "date": "2026-10-18", "notes": "Long run upgraded from 14 easy to 15 with a 4-mile MP block in the back half, to replace Thursday's MP work. This is a bigger stimulus than it looks because the MP comes on tired-ish legs — do not over-pace. If the MP block falls apart (pace slips past 8:15 and won't come back, or HR won't drop under 165 between reps-worth of effort), convert the last 4 mi back to easy and jog home. Report back on how the block felt and how fueling sat during MP effort.", "dayType": "long"}], "week": "2026-W42"}, "recentHistoryLimit": 4}
